<Routine Name="P206_Scale" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[**********************************************************
Scale- Communication Loss Fault
*********************************************************]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[NEQ(P206_SCL206.Comm_Code,16384) TON(P206_SCL206.CommLoss_Tmr,?,?) XIC(P206_SCL206.CommLoss_Tmr.DN) ,XIC(P206_SCL206.Flt.CommLoss) XIO(P206_Conv.Reset) ]OTE(P206_SCL206.Flt.CommLoss);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Read the incoming data

The requested data (usually the weight) is returned in the Input Words 1 and 2.  For the data to be valid, the Data OK status bit must be ON, and the two Data Integrity bits must match polarity. Any time the Integrity bits do NOT match, the data SHOULD BE DISCARDED!

If the Data OK bit is off, then a major error has been recorded at the scale.  Flag the error by forcing a -9999.0 into the returned weight value.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataOk) [XIC(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataIntegrity1) XIC(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataIntegrity2) ,XIO(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataIntegrity1) XIO(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataIntegrity2) ] CPS(SCL206:I.Slot1.FPdata1,SCL206_RawREAL_Data,1) DTOS(SCL206_RawREAL_Data,SCL206_RawString_Data) ,XIC(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataOk) [XIC(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataIntegrity1) XIO(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataIntegrity2) ,XIO(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataIntegrity1) XIC(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataIntegrity2) ] CPS(DataIntegrity_Error_String,SCL206_RawString_Data,1) ,XIO(SCL206:I.Slot1.DataOk) [CPS(Scale_Raw_Data_Error,SCL206_RawString_Data,1) ,MOV(-9999,SCL206_RawREAL_Data) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOV(17,SCL206:O.Slot1Command);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(SCL206:I.Slot1.Slot1_InputBit3)ONS(SCL206_Ons)[OTL(P206_SCL206_RawData_Available) ,ADD(Test_MP_Weight_P206,1,Test_MP_Weight_P206) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(P206_SCL206_RawData_Available)[TON(SCL206_Raw_Data_Wait_TMR,?,?) ,XIC(SCL206_Raw_Data_Wait_TMR.DN) CPS(SCL206_RawString_Data,SCL206_Processed_Raw_Data,1) OTL(P206_SCL206_Processed_RawData_Available) OTU(P206_SCL206_RawData_Available) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[************************************************************************************************************************
Update Raw Scale data to input data string for AOI logic.
************************************************************************************************************************

]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(P206_SCL206_Processed_RawData_Available)[NEQ(SCL206_Processed_Raw_Data,Empty_Weight) [CPS(SCL206_Processed_Raw_Data,P206_SCL206.RawData,1) OTL(P206_SCL206.RawData_Available) ,ADD(1,P206_Scale_RawData_History_Index,P206_Scale_RawData_History_Index) GRT(P206_Scale_RawData_History_Index,499) MOV(0,P206_Scale_RawData_History_Index) ,COP(P206_SCL206.RawData,P206_Scale_RawData_History[P206_Scale_RawData_History_Index].Raw_Data,1) COP(PLC.String_TS,P206_Scale_RawData_History[P206_Scale_RawData_History_Index].Found_Timestamp,1) MOV(P206_Scale_RawData_History_Index,P206_Scale_RawData_History[P206_Scale_RawData_History_Index].Seq_Number) ,COP(SCL206_RawString_Data,SCL206_RawString_Data_Prev,1) COP(SCL206_Processed_Raw_Data,SCL206_ProcessRaw_Data_Prev,1) COP(Empty_Weight,SCL206_RawString_Data,1) COP(Empty_Weight,SCL206_Processed_Raw_Data,1) ] ,TON(Processed_Weight_TImer,?,?) XIC(Processed_Weight_TImer.DN) OTU(P206_SCL206_Processed_RawData_Available) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
